# Footnotes in columns, in a table and with Keep together (reference/components/footnote.md), with the area styled.
# Page area of 260 × 160 from (20, 20), which ends at y = 180. Lines of 12 (Size 10) in the text; the footnote area
# (For element: Footnotes) has Size 8 (lines of 9.6; 4 pt per character), a top margin of 6, a rule of 1 and a padding of
# 3: 10 more than its notes, which are separated by a margin of 2 (For element: Footnote).
#
# cols: two columns of 120 (24 characters per line); c1 calls g and c2 calls h in their first lines, 6 lines each, and
#   the columns are balanced: 72. The notes go at the bottom of the page, not of the column.
# tab: a table after a margin of 8, at 100, with a cell that calls i: 12.
# kt: a block with Keep together, two lines (24), which calls j (3 lines of 9.6 = 28.8) in its second line.
# Page 1: with the four notes (28.8 + 3 × 9.6 + 3 × 2 + 10 = 73.6) only cols fits; with the three of cols and tab
#   (3 × 9.6 + 2 × 2 + 10 = 42.8) the page leaves 117.2, and cols and tab (112) fit: kt moves to page 2 with j. The
#   area, 36.8 high (4 + 32.8), at 143.2: g at 147.2, h at 158.8 and i at 170.4, 9.6 each.
# Page 2: kt at 20 and the area, 32.8 high, at 147.2, with j at 151.2.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 200
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
				Markup: markdown
		For element: Footnotes
			Typography:
				Size: 8
			Box:
				Margin: 6 0 0 0
				Border: 1 0 0 0
				Border color: #999999
				Padding: 3 0 0 0
		For element: Footnote
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 2 0
	Section:
		Columns:
			Id: cols
			Count: 2
			Gap: 20
			Paragraph:
				Id: c1
				Content >>
					ccccccc[^g] ccccccc ccccccc ccccccc ccccccc ccccccc ccccccc
					ccccccc ccccccc ccccccc ccccccc ccccccc ccccccc ccccccc
					ccccccc ccccccc ccccccc ccccccc
			Paragraph:
				Id: c2
				Content >>
					ddddddd[^h] ddddddd ddddddd ddddddd ddddddd ddddddd ddddddd
					ddddddd ddddddd ddddddd ddddddd ddddddd ddddddd ddddddd
					ddddddd ddddddd ddddddd ddddddd
		Footnote:
			Id: g
			Paragraph: Nota g.
		Footnote:
			Id: h
			Paragraph: Nota h.
		Table:
			Id: tab
			Column sizes: 100 *
			Box:
				Margin: 8 0 0 0
			Body:
				Row:
					Cell: Celda[^i]
					Cell: x
		Footnote:
			Id: i
			Paragraph: Nota i.
		Block:
			Id: kt
			Break:
				Keep together: true
			Paragraph:
				Id: k1
				Content >>
					kkkkkkkkk kkkkkkkkk kkkkkkkkk kkkkkkkkk kkkkkkkkk
					kkkkkkkkk[^j] kkkkkkkkk kkkkkkkkk kkkkkkkkk kkkkkkkkk
			Footnote:
				Id: j
				Paragraph:
					Content >>
						jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj
						jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj
						jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj jjjjjjjjj
